{"id":"9611c23f91c8d5e4","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set.md","title":"ZFC Order2 Directed Set","display":"df-zfc-order2-directed-set — ZFC Order2 Directed Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set","58-df-zfc-order6-directed-set"],"display":"df-zfc-order2-directed-set — ZFC Order2 Directed Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order2-directed-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-directed-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order2-directed-set — ZFC Order2 Directed Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,X\\in V\">\\(D,X\\in V\\)</span> (carrier sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_D\\subseteq D\\times D\">\\(\\leq_D\\subseteq D\\times D\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span> (order relations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6DirectedSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6DirectedSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (canonical predicate and historical alias)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}directed\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_D)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(D,\\leq_D)\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_D\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}directed\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_D)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(D,\\leq_D)\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_D\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}directed\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6DirectedSet}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(X,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}directed\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6DirectedSet}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(X,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Directedness includes nonemptiness and the full partial-order laws, including antisymmetry.</li>\n<li>The order6 name is retained only as an alias of the canonical predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_D\\subseteq D\\times D","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6DirectedSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}directed\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(D,\\leq_D)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(D,\\leq_D)\\land D\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\exists z\\in D\\;(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_D\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_D)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order6\\text{-}directed\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6DirectedSet}_S(X,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2DirectedSet}_S(X,R)","display":true}],"bytes":1407,"backlinks":[{"id":"08219b32ce